# The gauntlet case battery (U7). One JSON object per line.
# id/category/app/goal name the case; setup builds the sandbox workspace
# (files, dirs, the browser start url); check is deterministic where the
# task allows one (title_regex, file_exists, url_host, rsh_log,
# window_workspace, geometry_changed, window_focused) and `judge` otherwise;
# learnable cases get a learn turn and a second run (R18); held_out cases
# score the release pass rate and never feed the failure ranking (KTD9).
# sessions limits a case to the sessions that have what it needs (default
# both); skip names a gap that keeps it from passing anywhere. The driver
# prints every skipped case and scores only the cases it ran.
# minimal_steps is the fewest steps a clean run takes: a run 1 already at
# that count leaves a learnable case no headroom for a skill win.
# No case touches an account, and none asks to send, submit, buy or delete.
